okbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|cornmeal]]\n* Freshly-squeezed [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* ½ cup frozen [[Cookbook:Orange Juice|orange juice]] concentrate\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Hoisin Sauce|hoisin sauce]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Sriracha|sriracha]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 1 tbsp grated [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* 2 ½ [[Cookbook:Quart|quarts]] [[Cookbook:Peanut Oil|peanut oil]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#[[Cookbook:Dredging|Dredge]] shrimp into flour then dip into cornmeal. Set aside 2–3 minutes.\n#Meanwhile, heat oil in a deep-fryer or a pot to 375°F. Add shrimp and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] until golden brown. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Wire Rack|wire rack]].\n#Meanwhile, heat remaining ingredients in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]] over medium-high heat until [[Cookbook:Boiling|boiling]]. Add shrimp and [[Cookbook:Mixing|toss]] to coat.\n#Serve immediately.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using shrimp]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peanut oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Sweet and Spicy Shrimp","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 pound shrimp, shelled","sourceText":"1 pound shrimp, shelled","amountText":"1 pound shrimp, shelled","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup all-purpose flour","sourceText":"1 cup all-purpose flour","amountText":"1 cup all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit"